IMPORT `taa-procedure`
IMPORT `sda-home`
IMPORT `sda-vehicles`
IMPORT `fhog-grant`
IMPORT `sda-seat`

-- Stamp Duties Act 1923 (SA) with the First Home and Housing Construction Grants Act 2000 -- cases for the buyer's
-- questions (sda-seat.l4), asked with plain answers as the buyer would give them.
--
-- First GENERATED by scratchpad au-sa-1/gen_seat_cases.py, and edited by au-sa-1-f/edit_seat_cases.py in the fix of
-- 24 October 2026; both only spell out the argument lists. Every expected value was
-- worked by hand from the deposited texts (with the scale, surcharge, vehicle and interest arithmetic checked in the
-- independent calculator au-sa-1/hand.py) and typed into the script; none was copied from this encoding's output.
-- "The relevant day" is 13 February 2025, as the deposited legislative history records it (NOTES.md, finding 3).
--
-- Based on content from the South Australian Legislation website (CC BY 4.0). Not the official text. See NOTES.md.

§ `Cases -- the buyer's questions`

§§ `Buying a home -- the duty`

-- $600 000 bought at market value: $21 330 plus $5.50 per $100 over $500 000, $26 830.
#ASSERT `What duty is charged on my home before any relief` 600000 600000 TRUE TRUE EQUALS 26830
-- A gift of a home worth $400 000: the market value, $16 330.
#ASSERT `What duty is charged on my home before any relief` 0 400000 FALSE FALSE EQUALS 16330
-- Bought for $590 000 where the market value is $650 000 and the Commissioner will not take the price: $29 580.
#ASSERT `What duty is charged on my home before any relief` 590000 650000 TRUE FALSE EQUALS 29580
-- Transferring a half share of our home to my spouse: exempt.
#ASSERT `Is the transfer of our home between us exempt` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
-- After separating, with the Commissioner satisfied it follows the breakdown: exempt.
#ASSERT `Is the transfer of our home between us exempt` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE
-- After separating, the Commissioner not satisfied: not exempt.
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the transfer of our home between us exempt` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- A shop-top home that is part of commercial premises: not a shared residence.
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the transfer of our home between us exempt` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- Signed in Adelaide on 15 March 2026: by 15 May 2026.
#ASSERT `By when must the duty be paid and the transfer stamped` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 15) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 15) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 5 15
-- Signed in Melbourne on 1 March 2026, arriving on 10 June 2026: by 10 August 2026.
#ASSERT `By when must the duty be paid and the transfer stamped` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 6 10) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 8 10
-- Not stamped in time and no defence: up to $10 000.
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for not stamping in time` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS 10000
-- Handed to the seller's conveyancer expecting them to stamp it: the s 20(6) defence.
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for not stamping in time` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS 0

§§ `Buying a new home or land to build on -- the relief`

-- A first home buyer of a new home, contract 1 September 2026, $640 000: qualifies.
#ASSERT `Do I qualify for the relief on a new home or land` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no duty is payable`
-- An established home (lived in before): no relief.
#ASSERT `Do I qualify for the relief on a new home or land` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no relief: s 71DD does not apply`
-- A substantially renovated home sold as new residential premises, not lived in since: a new home, qualifies.
#ASSERT `Do I qualify for the relief on a new home or land` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no duty is payable`
-- Vacant land to build on, $480 000: qualifies.
#ASSERT `Do I qualify for the relief on a new home or land` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 480000 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no duty is payable`
-- Having owned an investment flat never lived in: barred for a contract after the relevant day.
#ASSERT `Do I qualify for the relief on a new home or land` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no relief: s 71DD does not apply`
-- Not every owner joins the application: no relief.
#ASSERT `Do I qualify for the relief on a new home or land` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no relief: s 71DD does not apply`
-- The 2026 new home: nil instead of $29 030.
#ASSERT `How much duty do I pay after the relief` 640000 640000 TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- An established home at $640 000: the full $29 030.
#ASSERT `How much duty do I pay after the relief` 640000 640000 TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 29030
-- A new home contracted on 10 January 2024 at $680 000, in the phase-out band: not covered (the s 71DD(7) formula is missing).
#ASSERT `How much duty do I pay after the relief` 680000 680000 TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2024 1 10) 680000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not covered` `the s 71DD(7) formula for the reduction on a pre-6 June 2024 contract in the phase-out band is missing from the deposited text`
-- A foreign co-buyer of half of the 2026 new home (her partner a citizen): s 71DD(11a) leaves 7% of $320 000, $22 400.
#ASSERT `How much foreign ownership surcharge must I pay` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 320000 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 22400
-- The same purchase on a contract of 1 December 2024, before the relevant day: the nil relief reaches the surcharge.
#ASSERT `How much foreign ownership surcharge must I pay` (YearMonthDay 2024 12 1) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 320000 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- A permanent visa holder: no surcharge.
#ASSERT `How much foreign ownership surcharge must I pay` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE 320000 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- s 71DD(9)(b), (9a): the 2026 new home bought under a contract that replaces one made before 6 June 2024. Without the
-- Commissioner's (9a) determination, no relief and the full $29 030; with it, the original contract's relief, which turns
-- on that contract's facts: not covered.
#ASSERT `Do I qualify for the relief on a new home or land` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no relief: s 71DD does not apply`
#ASSERT `Do I qualify for the relief on a new home or land` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the relief the original contract would have qualified for (s 71DD(9a)), which is not encoded`
#ASSERT `How much duty do I pay after the relief` 640000 640000 TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 29030
#ASSERT `How much duty do I pay after the relief` 640000 640000 TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not covered` `the s 71DD(9a) relief of the original contract turns on that contract's own facts and is not encoded`
-- s 71DB: an off-the-plan apartment bought for $450 000 under a contract of 1 March 2016 that the Commissioner accepts:
-- not covered (s 71DB is not encoded). Not accepted: the general scale, $18 830 (a contract before 15 June 2023 has no
-- s 71DD relief, s 71DD(3)(a)). A 2026 contract cannot be a qualifying off-the-plan contract, so the new home's nil relief stands.
#ASSERT `How much duty do I pay after the relief` 450000 450000 TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2016 3 1) 450000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not covered` `s 71DB (off-the-plan apartments, contracts up to 30 June 2017) is not encoded, and its s 71DB(3)(a) dutiable value formula is missing from the deposited text`
#ASSERT `How much duty do I pay after the relief` 450000 450000 TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2016 3 1) 450000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 18830
#ASSERT `How much duty do I pay after the relief` 640000 640000 TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- A foreign co-buyer of half of a new home contracted on 1 December 2024 (before the relevant day) that replaces a
-- contract made before 6 June 2024, with the (9a) determination: whether the relief reaches the surcharge turns on the
-- original contract's relief, so not covered. On a 2026 contract, s 71DD(11a) leaves the full $22 400 either way.
#ASSERT `How much foreign ownership surcharge must I pay` (YearMonthDay 2024 12 1) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 320000 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `not covered` `the s 71DD(9a) relief of the original contract turns on that contract's own facts and is not encoded`
#ASSERT `How much foreign ownership surcharge must I pay` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 320000 640000 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 22400

§§ `Keeping the relief`

-- A new home transferred on 1 August 2026: move in by 1 August 2027.
#ASSERT `By when must we start living in the home to keep the relief` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2027 8 1
-- Vacant land transferred on 1 August 2026, a home first usable on 15 March 2028: before 15 March 2029, so by 14 March 2029.
#ASSERT `By when must we start living in the home to keep the relief` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2028 3 15) 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2029 3 14
-- Moved in on 1 September 2026: stay until 1 March 2027.
#ASSERT `Until when must we keep living in the home` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2027 3 1
-- The relief lost on a $640 000 home: $29 030.
#ASSERT `What duty becomes payable if we lose the relief` 640000 EQUALS 29030
-- Moved out on 15 January 2027: pay by 15 March 2027.
#ASSERT `By when must the duty be paid once the relief is lost` (YearMonthDay 2027 1 15) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2027 3 15
-- $29 580 paid 200 days after the transfer at a 4.1% market rate, not deliberate: interest 715 836/365 plus 25% penalty tax $7 395.
#ASSERT `What is the most interest and penalty tax when the relief is lost` 29580 TRUE 200 4.1 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (715836 DIVIDED BY 365) PLUS 7395
-- The same, told the Commissioner in writing before any audit: penalty tax reduced by 80% to $1 479.
#ASSERT `What is the most interest and penalty tax when the relief is lost` 29580 TRUE 200 4.1 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (715836 DIVIDED BY 365) PLUS 1479
-- The Commissioner does not charge them: nothing.
#ASSERT `What is the most interest and penalty tax when the relief is lost` 29580 FALSE 200 4.1 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS 0

§§ `Foreign buyers -- refund of the surcharge`

-- A permanent visa on 1 May 2027, eleven months after acquiring on 1 June 2026, still owning: refund.
#ASSERT `Must the surcharge be refunded to me` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2027 5 1) TRUE
-- A permanent visa on 2 June 2027, more than 12 months after: no refund.
#ASSERT NOT (`Must the surcharge be refunded to me` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2027 6 2) TRUE)

§§ `The first home owner grant`

-- A new home bought for $550 000 under a contract of 1 May 2026: $15 000.
#ASSERT `How much first home owner grant do I get` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 5 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) 550000 FALSE 550000 FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 15000
-- An established home: nothing (s 18(4a)).
#ASSERT `How much first home owner grant do I get` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 5 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) 550000 FALSE 550000 FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- Not yet living there and not paid in anticipation: not payable yet.
#ASSERT `How much first home owner grant do I get` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 5 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) 550000 FALSE 550000 FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- Having owned residential property before: not payable (s 11(3)).
#ASSERT `How much first home owner grant do I get` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 5 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) 550000 FALSE 550000 FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- Applied on 2 August 2027, after the period, without the Commissioner's leave: not payable.
#ASSERT `How much first home owner grant do I get` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 5 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) 550000 FALSE 550000 FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2027 8 2) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- A comprehensive home building contract for $9 500: the lesser, $9 500.
#ASSERT `How much first home owner grant do I get` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 5 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2027 3 1) 9500 FALSE 400000 FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2027 4 1) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 9500
-- s 18BB(1)(b): a building contract commencing on 1 January 2024 (cap $650 000, s 7(1a)(ia)) for $400 000, on land the
-- Commissioner values at $300 000 when the contract was made: market value $700 000, over the cap, no grant. For
-- $300 000 on the same land: $600 000, within the cap, $15 000. For $300 000 where the Commissioner puts the actual cost
-- at $380 000: $680 000, over the cap, no grant.
#ASSERT `How much first home owner grant do I get` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2024 1 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2024 9 1) 400000 FALSE 300000 FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2024 9 15) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
#ASSERT `How much first home owner grant do I get` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2024 1 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2024 9 1) 300000 FALSE 300000 FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2024 9 15) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 15000
#ASSERT `How much first home owner grant do I get` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2024 1 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2024 9 1) 300000 FALSE 300000 TRUE 380000 FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2024 9 15) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- A new home contracted on 1 October 2012: the amount is not covered (bonus grants).
#ASSERT `How much first home owner grant do I get` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2012 10 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2012 12 1) 400000 FALSE 400000 FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 2 13) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2013 1 1) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not covered` `the grant amounts before 15 October 2012 involve bonus grants whose formulas are missing (ss 18B, 18BA) and are not encoded`
-- Completed on 1 August 2026: apply by 1 August 2027.
#ASSERT `By when must I apply for the grant` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2027 8 1
-- Completed on 1 August 2026: move in by 1 August 2027.
#ASSERT `By when must I move in for the grant` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2027 8 1
-- Moved in on 1 September 2026: stay until 1 March 2027.
#ASSERT `Until when must I live in the home for the grant` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2027 3 1
-- Paid in anticipation; on 10 March 2027 it becomes clear we will not move in: notify and repay by 24 March 2027.
#ASSERT `By when must I notify the Commissioner and repay the grant` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) 0 0 (YearMonthDay 2027 3 10) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2027 3 24
-- A grant of $15 000 paid on a false statement and not repaid: penalties up to $30 000.
#ASSERT `What is the most penalty if I must repay the grant` 15000 TRUE TRUE EQUALS 30000
-- A market rate of 4.35%: 12.35% a year on instalments.
#ASSERT `What interest rate applies to repaying the grant by instalments` 4.35 EQUALS 12.35
-- Notice of the decision dated 1 March 2026: object by 30 April 2026.
#ASSERT `By when must I object to a grant decision` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 4 30

§§ `Challenging a stamp duty assessment`

-- Assessment served on 1 March 2026: object by 30 April 2026.
#ASSERT `By when must I object to a duty assessment` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 4 30
-- Determination served on 10 June 2026: appeal by 9 August 2026.
#ASSERT `By when must I appeal to the Supreme Court` (YearMonthDay 2026 6 10) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 8 9
-- Duty assessed at $29 580: pay $14 790 before appealing.
#ASSERT `How much must I pay before I can appeal` 29580 EQUALS 14790

§§ `Registering a car`

-- A new car listed at $38 000 plus $2 000 of options, registered for 12 months: $1 540 plus $60.
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` TRUE TRUE 38000 2000 FALSE FALSE 40000 40000 FALSE FALSE 12 FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 1600
-- A second-hand car bought for $15 000, worth $17 000, transferred into my name: $620, no policy component.
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` FALSE FALSE 0 0 TRUE FALSE 15000 17000 FALSE FALSE 12 FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 620
-- The same new car registered by a holder of a Commonwealth pensioner card with reduced fares: the policy component is exempt, $1 540.
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` TRUE TRUE 38000 2000 FALSE FALSE 40000 40000 FALSE FALSE 12 FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 1540
-- Registering a $25 000 unregistered vehicle for 6 months: $940 plus $30.
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` TRUE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE 40000 25000 FALSE FALSE 6 FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 970
-- The registration transferred to me from my spouse: exempt.
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` FALSE FALSE 38000 2000 FALSE FALSE 40000 40000 FALSE FALSE 12 FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- Transferred to me from my former spouse after we separated, the Commissioner satisfied it follows the breakdown:
-- exempt (s 71CB(2)(a)(ii), (3)). Not satisfied: the duty on a $17 000 car not bought, $620.
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE 0 17000 FALSE FALSE 12 FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE 0 17000 FALSE FALSE 12 FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 620
-- s 42BA: I add my adult son as a co-owner of my $17 000 car and stay on the registration: its formula is missing, so
-- not covered. Adding my wife instead: exempt under s 71CB, which s 42BA(2) keeps whole.
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE TRUE 0 17000 FALSE FALSE 12 FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not covered` `the s 42BA formula for a transfer of registration to or from a continuing owner is missing from the deposited text`
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE TRUE 0 17000 FALSE FALSE 12 FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- Entitled to the s 38 reduced fee: nothing.
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` TRUE TRUE 38000 2000 FALSE FALSE 40000 40000 FALSE FALSE 12 FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- A registration of 13 months: not covered.
#ASSERT `What duty is payable on registering my vehicle` TRUE TRUE 38000 2000 FALSE FALSE 40000 40000 FALSE FALSE 13 FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not covered` `a registration period longer than 12 months is not in the Schedule 2 clause 2(3) table`
